              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "annieroon"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very good but thought it was salty from the soy sauce. Next time I'll use 50% salt reduced broth. I changed white sugar to brown and eliminated the extra calories of the molasses. I'd give it a four star also.",
            "datePublished": "2014-01-20T19:43:30.723Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
